{"id":54295,"date":"2026-07-22T06:58:29","date_gmt":"2026-07-22T05:58:29","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/beer-run-sao-bras-de-alportel\/"},"modified":"2026-08-29T16:53:34","modified_gmt":"2026-08-29T15:53:34","slug":"beer-run-sao-bras-de-alportel","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/beer-run-sao-bras-de-alportel\/","title":{"rendered":"Beer Run S\u00e3o Br\u00e1s de Alportel 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- IN\u00cdCIO BLOCO REUTILIZ\u00c1VEL: M\u00d3DULO 1 - DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre O <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Beer Run S\u00e3o Br\u00e1s de Alportel 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">A <strong>Beer Run S\u00e3o Br\u00e1s de Alportel 2026<\/strong> realiza-se no dia <strong>15 de agosto de 2026 (S\u00e1bado)<\/strong>, em <strong>Parque das Amendoeiras<\/strong> (S\u00e3o Br\u00e1s de Alportel, distrito de Faro). Trata-se de um divertido e desafiante evento desportivo inspirado no conceito internacional de &#8216;beer mile&#8217;, promovendo o desporto, o conv\u00edvio e a anima\u00e7\u00e3o noturna em pleno Algarve.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Com partida agendada para as <strong>20h30<\/strong>, o evento apresenta o formato de <strong>1 Milha Terrestre (~1,6 km)<\/strong>, composta por 4 voltas de 402 metros no Parque das Amendoeiras, exigindo o consumo de uma cerveja de 33 cl antes de iniciar cada volta. Se procura preparar o seu calend\u00e1rio de provas, pode consultar o nosso direct\u00f3rio de <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/corridas-algarve\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline; font-weight: 500;\">calend\u00e1rio de corridas no Algarve<\/a>.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">O evento \u00e9 uma organiza\u00e7\u00e3o da Free Challenge \u2013 Associa\u00e7\u00e3o Desportiva e S\u00f3cio-Cultural, contando com o apoio da C\u00e2mara Municipal de S\u00e3o Br\u00e1s de Alportel para garantir um ambiente festivo, seguro e bem estruturado para todos os participantes com idade igual ou superior a 18 anos.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- IN\u00cdCIO BLOCO REUTILIZ\u00c1VEL: M\u00d3DULO 2 - FICHA T\u00c9CNICA --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong cla